[{"id":163407854,"discussion_id":"6d0b899f54047b6de48196f11cb5ae2191eeaacc","body":"Thanks for your pull-request.\nThe full list of commands accepted by me can be found at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/infrastructure/blob/main/docs/robot/robot%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97.md#-%E5%A6%82%E9%9C%80%E4%BA%86%E8%A7%A3%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E7%9A%84%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4%E5%8F%AF%E5%8F%82%E8%80%83%E4%B8%8B%E6%96%B9%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E8%A1%A8%E6%A0%BC)。\nYou can get sig-info at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/community/blob/master/CANN/sigs/ops-nn/sig-info.yaml)\n\n\n---\n\n## PR Approval Progress\n\n✅ **Congratulations! All modules have met the lgtm and approve requirements.**\n\n### Module Approval Details\n\n| module | lgtm status | approve status |\n|------|-----------|--------------|\n| index | ✅ [*zhou-qilong*](https://gitcode.com/zhou-qilong), [*crystalhu*](https://gitcode.com/crystalhu) (2/2) | ✅ [*zhou-qilong*](https://gitcode.com/zhou-qilong), [*crystalhu*](https://gitcode.com/crystalhu) (2/1) |\n\n> \uD83D\uDCA1 Tip:\n> - **Committer** can comment `/approve` or `/lgtm`\n> - Commenting `/approve` implies both code review (lgtm) and intent to merge (approve)\n","created_at":"2026-02-24T16:13:29+08:00","updated_at":"2026-02-25T17:32:46+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":163407897,"discussion_id":"267f342aa56095bda6c2c76dfc382a5967c8f2b3","body":":large_blue_circle: source code change are detected, tasks labels is removed in this pull request!","created_at":"2026-02-24T16:13:36+08:00","updated_at":"2026-02-24T16:13:36+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":163408036,"discussion_id":"1b52a28ee990a4990615aa1e0cff52f4565e7593","body":"## 问题/功能描述\n\n本次PR包含三个独立的代码修复和优化。主要解决了SIMD排序分片算法中，在特定条件下（`indicesCastMode_`为0且`ubBlock`不等于对齐大小时）计算内存占用不准确的笔误问题，可能导致分片策略错误和性能异常。同时，修复了在索引轴上进行分核并行计算时，索引偏移量计算错误导致的数据访问冲突和结果错误的问题。此外，为提升代码可读性，在公共头文件中增加了用于替换“魔法数字”的常量定义。\n\n## 修改方案描述\n\n1.  **修复内存计算笔误**：在`DoOpTilingSplitIndicesSort`函数中，修正了`indicesCastMode_ == 0`分支下`indicesSize`的计算公式，为其补充了缺失的对齐操作（`CeilAlign`），使其与函数内其他分支及`DoOpTilingSplitAfterSort`函数中的逻辑保持一致，确保内存占用量计算的准确性。\n2.  **修复并行计算偏移**：在`ComputeSumAndCopyOutSlitIndices`函数中，将`indicesOfset`的计算从局部偏移修正为基于当前核ID和每个核分配的索引数量计算的全局偏移，确保多核并行时各核访问正确的、互不重叠的数据段。\n3.  **增加常量定义**：在`inplace_index_add_common.h`文件中新增了`TWO`、`THREE`、`FOUR`三个`constexpr`常量，用于后续替换代码中的硬编码数字，提升代码可读性和可维护性。","created_at":"2026-02-24T16:14:20+08:00","updated_at":"2026-02-24T16:14:20+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":163410536,"discussion_id":"3d48babb507daf8523073ec742fd5c788761c208","body":"compile","created_at":"2026-02-24T16:31:53+08:00","updated_at":"2026-02-24T16:31:53+08:00","user":{"id":"68abc1ea0f820658f05c100a","login":"jinpenghe","object_id":"68abc1ea0f820658f05c100a","name":"jinpenghe","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/ac/db/7a9c5d737bf8da0ecb92e0cf3ee5c8dc68250629ebcdc54d2febaae600c67b83.jpg","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/jinpenghe"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":163410603,"discussion_id":"43f2071c8fcd1a22d725176e078154674dec7909","body":"流水线任务触发成功 [<b><a href='https://gitcode.com/cann/infrastructure/blob/mai